// Ch1 C1-06 to C1-07: the way up is a current, a vertical shaft where the tower breathes with the
// tide (U08). Rhen clips on and lets it take him, and hums under his breath, once through, the
// current-song his father taught him for reading water (rhen_current_hum: a working tune, a chart,
// NOT the Hush lullaby). The hum has no words. Then U09: up through the Snell window toward noon, and
// the music comes up from under the water into oruvel_raft. The chapter flow goes on to ch01/oruvel,
// whose arrival fades in on O01 (one continuous rise, U09 -> O01). Ends faded out (the hand-off).
title: ch01_current_shaft
location: ch01/oruvel_underway
---
@camera U08
@anim rhen clip_on
Rhen [neutral]: Tide's breathing out. Right on time. #line:ch01_shaft_001
@music rhen_current_hum
@wait 6.0
@camera U09 blend=2.0
@music oruvel_raft fade=3.0
@fade out 1.5
===
